extends layout.pug

block content

  article.portfolio-intro

    //- Replace with your own heading like 'My Portfolio', or 'Hey, Potential Employers', or 'Let's make the web great together!' 
    h1 My FullStack JavaScript Portfolio

    //- Replace with a description for your portfolio, what this project is, it's purpose, what it's supposed to accomplish, etc. 
    p Welcome to my Web Development Portfolio. This collection showcases projects built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, demonstrating my ability to create responsive, interactive, and user-friendly web applications. Throughout these projects, I have focused on developing clean and maintainable code, implementing modern design principles, and enhancing user experiences through dynamic functionality.


  article.portfolio-project-thumbs
    .projects-box.box.grid

      each project in data
        .cell
          a(href= `project/${project.id}`)
            img.thumbnail(src=project.image_urls[0], alt=project.title)
            h5= project.name

  


